    <h1>Explore customer projects and agreements</h1>
    <p>Northstar Logistics has a depot rollout and a staff training project. A framework agreement sets shared terms; a delivery order specifies the depot work. Start with <strong>Commitments</strong> to see what is due, then filter by project or agreement.</p>
    <p><strong>If proposed amendment AMD-001 were accepted, which deliveries should the team review?</strong></p>
    <div id="contract-explorer-widget"><ContractExplorer /></div>
    <p>The proposed amendment adds a written test summary for the interface package. Use <strong>Explore change impact</strong> to find the linked delivery and the customer workshop that depends on it. These connections help the team identify what to review before accepting the amendment.</p>
    <p><a href={siteUrl('chapters/09-images/')}>Return to Chapter 9: Information You Can Explore</a></p>
